			"offsets": {
				"from": 0,
				"to": 8620
			},
			"text": "なんかあの歩くバールのように扱われているロバがなんとなく愛おしく感じてきたんですけど"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:08,620",
				"to": "00:00:18,440"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 8620,
				"to": 18440
			},
			"text": "うん ちょっとの方を聞き上げというかなか人間の生活にすごく近いところにいるような感じが"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:18,440",
				"to": "00:00:25,880"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 18440,
				"to": 25880
			},
			"text": "うるさいでしょうねとかねうん 本格が何がによってもん"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:25,880",
				"to": "00:00:35,220"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 25880,
				"to": 35220
			},
			"text": "どうやってなき声あるんですか?うん アウトリスメンでよなぁ"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:35,220",
				"to": "00:00:42,560"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 35220,
				"to": 42560
			},
			"text": "まあそうかもしれないね まあ音量だから ああそうかー"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:50,060",
				"to": "00:00:54,400"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 50060,
				"to": 54400
			},
			"text": "いやあそうさん 教師の状態にうまんのおくときは"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:54,400",
				"to": "00:00:56,400"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 54400,
				"to": 56400
			},
			"text": "本当"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:56,400",
				"to": "00:01:02,400"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 56400,
				"to": 62400
			},
			"text": "話してると乗りたくなっていくでしょうね きっとね"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:02,400",
				"to": "00:01:05,400"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 62400,
				"to": 65400
			},
			"text": "うん できるとも"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:05,400",
				"to": "00:01:07,400"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 65400,
				"to": 67400
			},
			"text": "うん"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:07,400",
				"to": "00:01:13,460"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 67400,
				"to": 73460
			},
			"text": "「体が覚えてくるでしょうね」"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:13,460",
				"to": "00:01:15,520"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 73460,
				"to": 75520
			},
			"text": "「体が覚えてるでしょうね」"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:15,520",
				"to": "00:01:20,740"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 75520,
				"to": 80740
			},
			"text": "「そうね。もう乗った途端に分かってしまうみたいですよね」"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:20,740",
				"to": "00:01:26,940"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 80740,
				"to": 86940
			},
			"text": "「あの馬の背中に乗っちゃえばもう大丈夫でしょうね。車が高いから」"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:26,940",
				"to": "00:01:31,720"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 86940,
				"to": 91720
			},
			"text": "「乗っちゃえばもう全然、どこでもいける感じでしょうね」"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:31,720",
				"to": "00:01:34,740"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 91720,
				"to": 94740
			},
			"text": "「乗るのは一人で乗れるの?」"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:34,740",
				"to": "00:01:37,300"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 94740,
				"to": 97300
			},
			"text": "「一人で乗れるの?」"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:37,400",
				"to": "00:01:40,880"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 97400,
				"to": 100880
			},
			"text": "「うん。あのー、台があることもあるわよね」"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:40,880",
				"to": "00:01:43,220"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 100880,
				"to": 103220
			},
			"text": "「台を用意しました」"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:43,220",
				"to": "00:01:46,940"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 103220,
				"to": 106940
			},
			"text": "「台ですよね。今は下から乗るのは大変だけども」"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:46,940",
				"to": "00:01:50,940"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 106940,
				"to": 110940
			},
			"text": "「下から乗るのは初めは覚えなきゃいけないですよね」"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:50,940",
				"to": "00:01:53,940"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 110940,
				"to": 113940
			},
			"text": "「あぶみの蔵を持って」"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:53,940",
				"to": "00:02:01,540"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 113940,
				"to": 121540
			},
			"text": "「でも安子さん、私は初めて見たフリシマス」"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:02:01,540",
				"to": "00:02:03,540"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 121540,
				"to": 123540
			},
			"text": "「うん。本当にそう」"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:02:03,540",
				"to": "00:02:07,020"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 123540,
				"to": 127020
			},
			"text": "「どんなサイストインプレッションですか?」"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:02:07,020",
				"to": "00:02:09,020"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 127020,
				"to": 129020
			},
			"text": "「違う人みたい?」"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:02:09,020",
				"to": "00:02:11,020"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 129020,
				"to": 131020
			},
			"text": "「しっこいコマンドがある」"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:02:11,020",
				"to": "00:02:13,080"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 131020,
				"to": 133080
			},
			"text": "「とても自信である」"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:02:13,080",
				"to": "00:02:22,620"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 133080,
				"to": 142620
			},
			"text": "「うん。そう。乗る。そう。乗る。」"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:02:22,620",
				"to": "00:02:24,560"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 142620,
				"to": 144560
			},
			"text": "「馬に乗る自信?」"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:02:24,560",
				"to": "00:02:30,040"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 144560,
				"to": 150040
			},
			"text": "「自信。自信しながら馬に乗っていることが」"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:02:30,040",
				"to": "00:02:32,040"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 150040,
				"to": 152040
			},
			"text": "「乗っていることが」"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:02:32,040",
				"to": "00:02:38,040"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 152040,
				"to": 158040
			},
			"text": "「そうね。でも初めての馬だったら自信、自信なんてないですよ。全然」"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:02:38,040",
				"to": "00:02:42,040"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 158040,
				"to": 162040
			},
			"text": "「もう知ってる馬だったらね」"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:02:42,040",
				"to": "00:02:46,040"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 162040,
				"to": 166040
			},
			"text": "「お互いに知ってれば」"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:02:46,040",
				"to": "00:02:52,040"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 166040,
				"to": 172040
			},
			"text": "「とても、私よりいい」"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:02:52,040",
				"to": "00:02:54,760"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 172040,
				"to": 174760
			},
			"text": "「持ってたんでしょ?自分の馬を」"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:02:54,760",
				"to": "00:02:56,520"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 174760,
				"to": 176520
			},
			"text": "「今乗ってないのよ。だから」"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:02:56,520",
				"to": "00:02:59,960"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 176520,
				"to": 179960
			},
			"text": "「今も持ってますね。今を」"
		}
	]
